## Trigger Block Arrays Declaration Template
##
## This template generates C code for declaring state variables needed
## by the Trigger block for edge detection.
##
## Available context variables:
## - block: The Trigger block instance
## - blockId: Unique block identifier
##
## Generated state variables:
## - triggerState_${blockId}: Stores previous trigger signal value for edge detection
## - triggerFlag_${blockId}: Boolean flag indicating if trigger event occurred

// Trigger Block State Variables: ${block.blockName} (ID: ${blockId})

// Previous trigger signal value for edge detection
double triggerState_${blockId};

// Trigger event flag (true when edge detected)
bool triggerFlag_${blockId};
